# 09: the FILL bar (hold L1 + Y), playing in the scene's last bar.
title THE FILL
about One bar for the scene's last time round: hold L1 and press Y on the drum grid, draw the fill, and it plays instead of the bar on the scene's last pass.
caption FILL
run --demo
from 0.5
length 22.0

0.7 say The drum grid. This scene plays twice round.
2.2 say Hold L1 and press Y: the FILL, a copy of the bar.
2.2 hold L1 1.0
2.6 tap Y
4.0 tap RIGHT 7 0.15
5.4 say Hold R1 and drag: a snare roll on its last steps.
5.4 hold R1 1.2
5.6 tap RIGHT 3 0.25
7.0 tap DOWN 4 0.15
7.8 hold R1 1.4
8.0 tap LEFT 3 0.3
9.8 say The FILL plays instead of the bar on the scene's last time round.
14.6 say Hold L1 and press Y on it: FILL OFF. Again: on.
14.6 hold L1 1.0
15.0 tap Y
18.0 hold L1 1.0
18.4 tap Y
